title: Establish the Administration
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: state_affairs
frequency: 100
view-if: petoria_mode = 1 and state_capacity < 90

= A Government on Paper

Petoria has a declaration, a flag, and a head of state. What it lacks is a reliable way to collect revenue, maintain records, or deliver basic services.

- @create_office: Establish a small civil service.
- @cut_corners: Run the state out of Peter's living room.

@create_office
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; state_capacity += 8; administrative_capacity += 6; petoria_treasury -= 3; legitimacy += 3
A few basic offices begin keeping accounts and recording decisions. It is not glamorous, but the state becomes more capable.

@cut_corners
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; petoria_treasury += 2; state_capacity -= 3; legitimacy -= 2; family_satisfaction.peter += 3
Peter keeps the bureaucracy small and the money close at hand. This saves money today and creates confusion tomorrow.
